---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const projects = (await getCollection('projects', ({ data }) => !data.draft)).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">DESIGN PORTFOLIO / 2026</p>
    <h1>생각을 정리하고,<br />경험을 디자인합니다<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="intro">작은 질문에서 시작해 더 나은 일상의 경험을 만듭니다.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="#work">프로젝트 살펴보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
  </section>
  <section id="work" class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2>Selected work</h2><span>01 / PROJECTS</span></div>
    {projects.map((project, index) => (
      <a class="project" href={`${base}projects/${project.id}/`}>
        <div class="project-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-shape"></span><span class="art-label">PROJECT {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span></div>
        <div class="project-meta"><span>{project.data.category} / {project.data.year}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <h3>{project.data.title}</h3><p>{project.data.description}</p>
      </a>
    ))}
  </section>
  <section id="about" class="section about">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h2>좋은 디자인은<br />좋은 질문에서 시작합니다.</h2>
    <p>이곳에 디자이너 소개와 관심 분야를 적어주세요.<br />현재 표시된 소개와 프로젝트는 편집용 샘플입니다.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
